// Cultural founding paths for the historic states in 10_historic.json that had only a list of
// tags and no answer to "what if the people who lived in it are the ones who rebuild it".
//
// These are additive on purpose. A formable declared here keeps every territory, stability,
// cost, politics and treaty check it already had; what changes is only who is allowed to lead
// the attempt. A people that once shared a state can be the one that proclaims it again, and
// that no longer depends on which government happens to be in office today.
